WEBVTT

00:00:04.140 --> 00:00:06.690
Thor, Rai, come here.

00:00:09.920 --> 00:00:15.860
Look; this is our home planet, the Earth.

00:00:16.340 --> 00:00:18.690
Ah! Beautiful!

00:00:19.620 --> 00:00:25.870
The Balkan System's planets have all been terraformed by man, modeling the planet Earth.

00:00:26.940 --> 00:00:32.170
No matter how similar their crusts are, none of them will ever be our home planet.

00:00:32.890 --> 00:00:36.630
But we're humans from the Balkan System too, aren't we?

00:00:37.850 --> 00:00:38.920
No, we're not.

00:00:39.490 --> 00:00:41.050
We are Earthlings.

00:00:41.780 --> 00:00:44.430
Sky is blue, water is sparkling;

00:00:44.760 --> 00:00:46.370
A planet filled with green:

00:00:47.530 --> 00:00:51.010
For humans, this is the planet where we were meant to live.

00:00:52.090 --> 00:00:56.070
Without the Earth, we won't be able to live on.

00:02:28.700 --> 00:02:29.470
This is?...

00:02:36.950 --> 00:02:38.610
Oi, are you ok?

00:02:40.030 --> 00:02:44.050
You had a high fever and you have passed out for 3 days.

00:02:49.150 --> 00:02:50.200
Soft...

00:02:51.570 --> 00:02:52.700
...a girl's hand.

00:02:53.530 --> 00:02:54.450
The first time I've seen...

00:02:55.680 --> 00:02:56.500
A girl?

00:02:57.870 --> 00:03:00.330
Uh, no... I mean, on this planet.

00:03:01.660 --> 00:03:04.550
Here men and women live separately, right?

00:03:05.230 --> 00:03:09.340
Women can bear children, so the Rings they're carefully protected.

00:03:10.420 --> 00:03:12.260
Who... are you?

00:03:13.330 --> 00:03:17.220
My name's Tiz, Sun Ring's female Second.

00:03:17.690 --> 00:03:19.440
Sun Ring?

00:03:23.480 --> 00:03:26.980
I'm Thor. Were you the one who saved me?

00:03:27.220 --> 00:03:27.990
I guess.

00:03:28.810 --> 00:03:29.570
Here is?

00:03:30.090 --> 00:03:31.610
Ochre Ring's stronghold.

00:03:32.090 --> 00:03:35.330
Ochre? Then why are you here, if you're from the Sun ring?

00:03:36.080 --> 00:03:40.500
Well, if I don't look after you, people from Ochre might beat you up.

00:03:42.380 --> 00:03:44.020
You were amazing!

00:03:44.290 --> 00:03:47.670
You're this little, you beat Ochre's Second!

00:03:49.940 --> 00:03:50.640
Rai!

00:03:52.210 --> 00:03:54.300
Where are you going?! You're shouldn't move yet.

00:03:54.760 --> 00:03:55.800
He's dead.

00:03:57.270 --> 00:03:58.520
You saw it!

00:04:02.560 --> 00:04:03.770
Rai!

00:04:06.190 --> 00:04:06.940
It couldn't be helped;

00:04:07.460 --> 00:04:08.900
he couldn't take care of himself.

00:04:09.330 --> 00:04:10.530
It's not your fault.

00:04:11.400 --> 00:04:13.070
Stop talking like it's something you understand!!!

00:04:13.570 --> 00:04:14.700
Oi, wait!

00:04:23.330 --> 00:04:24.120
Rai...

00:04:51.150 --> 00:04:51.820
That's...

00:04:52.300 --> 00:04:53.320
Dagger Pagoda.

00:04:56.680 --> 00:04:58.350
The tower built in order to reach space.

00:04:59.920 --> 00:05:03.600
Come on; with those injuries, you still want to fight?

00:05:05.270 --> 00:05:07.780
Oi oi, I only brought water...

00:05:07.790 --> 00:05:08.340
Don't move!

00:05:08.780 --> 00:05:09.610
Right, right.

00:05:10.470 --> 00:05:13.550
Thor, you were here.

00:05:14.750 --> 00:05:16.590
What were you talking to Third about?

00:05:17.690 --> 00:05:18.510
Third?

00:05:19.270 --> 00:05:22.220
This guy carried you all the way here;

00:05:22.690 --> 00:05:24.230
Ocher Ring's Third.

00:05:24.820 --> 00:05:27.190
Thanks for the introduction. It's a pleasure.

00:05:33.030 --> 00:05:36.200
Thor?! Are you ok?

00:05:36.900 --> 00:05:38.030
Here, it's water.

00:05:41.360 --> 00:05:42.750
For today, this is all we have.

00:05:43.250 --> 00:05:46.060
In 4 or 5 days, you'll be able to drink more.

00:05:47.190 --> 00:05:48.430
Hey, drink slowly!

00:05:48.760 --> 00:05:52.090
Don't worry, no one's going to do anything to you

00:05:52.490 --> 00:05:54.990
because I've chosen you as my husband.

00:05:57.120 --> 00:05:59.760
When you were fighting with people of Ochre,

00:06:00.050 --> 00:06:01.420
I just happened to be there.

00:06:01.760 --> 00:06:03.770
and I really liked you...

00:06:05.060 --> 00:06:08.350
You weren't punished because she favored you.

00:06:09.390 --> 00:06:10.980
On Chimera there aren't many women,

00:06:11.480 --> 00:06:14.310
so women have the right to choose from the men.

00:06:15.160 --> 00:06:15.780
How come?..

00:06:15.980 --> 00:06:16.610
See?

00:06:16.990 --> 00:06:17.910
I really have to?

00:06:18.300 --> 00:06:18.820
Yep.

00:06:20.760 --> 00:06:21.490
No.

00:06:22.590 --> 00:06:25.540
I don't want to be chosen by anyone.

00:06:25.990 --> 00:06:28.170
I'll make my own decisions for my own destiny.

00:06:29.760 --> 00:06:32.380
Ha hah! This is great!

00:06:34.150 --> 00:06:35.210
What's so funny?!

00:06:35.980 --> 00:06:38.010
Making decisions for your own destiny.

00:06:38.810 --> 00:06:41.260
Do you think that's something you can do on this planet?

00:06:41.620 --> 00:06:44.500
Yes I do! I'm leaving here right now!

00:06:45.890 --> 00:06:46.560
Thor?!

00:06:47.940 --> 00:06:51.020
Let him go. It's not like he'll be able to get out of here anyway.

00:07:00.350 --> 00:07:01.700
It's like a maze.

00:07:20.690 --> 00:07:22.080
A...are you ok?

00:07:23.520 --> 00:07:25.320
Do you have any food?

00:07:25.950 --> 00:07:28.210
I don't have anything, I...

00:07:28.300 --> 00:07:32.390
Was it you? The one who beat Second?

00:07:33.520 --> 00:07:35.690
And here I was thinking it was someone strong. Just a brat?!

00:07:36.400 --> 00:07:39.090
You're already walking around, huh?

00:07:39.150 --> 00:07:40.820
He's pretty tough.

00:07:41.120 --> 00:07:44.160
Cute face you've got there, isn't it?

00:07:44.580 --> 00:07:45.820
Let go of me!

00:07:46.400 --> 00:07:50.190
Hiding here, can't you do anything except bully the weak?!

00:07:51.240 --> 00:07:52.180
What?!

00:07:53.400 --> 00:07:54.580
<i>It's a Try!</i>

00:07:55.180 --> 00:07:55.880
<i>Don't miss it!</i>

00:07:55.920 --> 00:07:56.530
<i>Hurry up!</i>

00:07:56.530 --> 00:07:57.210
<i>Be quick!</i>

00:07:57.220 --> 00:07:59.570
Damn! I'll teach you a lesson later.

00:08:01.140 --> 00:08:01.800
Try?...

00:08:23.840 --> 00:08:24.660
A duel?

00:08:25.740 --> 00:08:27.230
'scuse me, sorry - I'm really sorry!

00:08:30.090 --> 00:08:32.030
Thor, you were here?!

00:08:32.140 --> 00:08:34.400
Tiz? Hey, this is...?

00:08:34.480 --> 00:08:38.090
It's a Try. Someone's challenging Top.

00:08:38.480 --> 00:08:40.550
If he wins, he'll become the Top.

00:08:41.040 --> 00:08:42.880
If you become the Top, you can do anything.

00:08:44.890 --> 00:08:47.810
This guy is... Ochre Ring's Top.

00:08:51.860 --> 00:08:52.890
So, Rada,

00:08:53.320 --> 00:08:55.210
in your opinion, who do you think is going to win?

00:08:55.510 --> 00:08:57.820
Well, Top of course.

00:08:58.220 --> 00:08:58.900
Why?

00:08:59.060 --> 00:09:02.320
If we're talking about physical strength, then the challenger... However...

00:09:10.410 --> 00:09:12.080
Ready... fight!

00:10:14.620 --> 00:10:17.310
That guy's protected his status as Top for years.

00:10:17.940 --> 00:10:20.610
Up to now, no one's ever beaten him.

00:10:21.340 --> 00:10:22.230
What about Third?

00:10:23.190 --> 00:10:25.340
That guy's different, he's...

00:10:25.350 --> 00:10:26.610
I'm what?

00:10:28.210 --> 00:10:29.200
Third?!

00:10:30.330 --> 00:10:31.450
Top wants to see you.

00:10:31.930 --> 00:10:34.540
He told me to take you there when you woke up.

00:10:37.270 --> 00:10:39.000
As expected, Top.

00:10:39.080 --> 00:10:40.250
You're invincible!

00:10:40.280 --> 00:10:40.960
Incredible!

00:10:41.340 --> 00:10:43.500
It won't be long before you become Jyu 0h.

00:10:43.660 --> 00:10:45.090
Mmm, I guess.

00:10:45.190 --> 00:10:45.670
Top?

00:10:50.680 --> 00:10:53.930
Was that you? The brat who beat Second?

00:10:54.520 --> 00:10:55.270
Your name!

00:10:56.210 --> 00:10:56.810
Thor.

00:10:58.740 --> 00:10:59.810
Nice eyes.

00:11:08.610 --> 00:11:09.570
Thor!

00:11:11.790 --> 00:11:14.400
For the sake of Sun Ring's female Second,

00:11:14.560 --> 00:11:16.440
I'll allow you to stay here for a while.

00:11:17.090 --> 00:11:19.290
But I cannot guarantee your life.

00:11:20.270 --> 00:11:24.750
Here only the strong survive, - like me.

00:11:37.910 --> 00:11:42.560
Well, well; you went down from a single slap, huh.

00:11:43.410 --> 00:11:45.650
Wait a second. I'll go get some food.

00:11:48.670 --> 00:11:50.370
But it's great, Thor.

00:11:50.680 --> 00:11:52.310
You are allowed to stay here now.

00:11:52.420 --> 00:11:53.730
This kind of place..

00:11:53.940 --> 00:11:56.270
Compared to the forest, this is much, much better.

00:11:56.660 --> 00:11:59.650
And anyway, Thor's going to be my husband, right?

00:11:59.890 --> 00:12:02.890
I've already said it; I can't be your husband.

00:12:03.960 --> 00:12:05.100
What are you talking about?

00:12:05.220 --> 00:12:07.220
Men don't have the right to refuse.

00:12:07.660 --> 00:12:10.660
I'm not going to obey the system here!

00:12:12.620 --> 00:12:13.470
Tiz.

00:12:14.300 --> 00:12:17.300
Rika, didn't you go back to the Sun Ring?

00:12:17.700 --> 00:12:21.600
I come for you; Chen's really angry.

00:12:23.120 --> 00:12:25.280
Thor and I are staying here together!

00:12:25.910 --> 00:12:29.060
I'll get Ochre's Top to talk to Chen.

00:12:29.360 --> 00:12:30.530
I don't want to!

00:12:31.110 --> 00:12:31.820
Thor?!

00:12:32.690 --> 00:12:35.110
Anyway, I'm not going back.

00:12:37.120 --> 00:12:38.190
Wait for me, Thor.

00:12:38.600 --> 00:12:40.200
I'll just go see Top.

00:12:40.470 --> 00:12:41.610
Wait, Tiz!

00:12:46.070 --> 00:12:48.630
Why do I have to get married here?...

00:12:50.770 --> 00:12:54.980
The government announced the average marriage age went down again:

00:12:55.880 --> 00:13:00.850
For girls, 13.8 years old; for boys 14.3 years old.

00:13:00.890 --> 00:13:03.690
Huh? Then we...

00:13:04.350 --> 00:13:06.950
need to get married in 5 years?

00:13:08.130 --> 00:13:10.630
I haven't even thought about it.

00:13:11.350 --> 00:13:12.220
Yeah.

00:13:17.300 --> 00:13:18.410
Eh... Hey, Thor?

00:13:18.660 --> 00:13:20.060
Can you do me a favor?

00:13:25.100 --> 00:13:28.090
Rai, did you think about it?

00:13:30.660 --> 00:13:34.110
I don't really want to date girls yet.

00:13:34.670 --> 00:13:37.530
I've got to study for next year's senior authorization.

00:13:38.180 --> 00:13:41.600
But Rai, your results are always the best.

00:13:42.250 --> 00:13:43.730
I have to be careful.

00:13:44.040 --> 00:13:45.690
I need to think about my dad's reputation too.

00:13:45.960 --> 00:13:50.950
They've already appointed Rai's dad as the next Juno's prime minister, right?!

00:13:51.510 --> 00:13:56.450
That's why I think you understand where I'm coming from.

00:13:57.820 --> 00:13:59.660
Mmm! I understand!

00:13:59.830 --> 00:14:02.490
Then, date with me after you finish your exams!

00:14:02.700 --> 00:14:03.750
l want to be the first!

00:14:04.040 --> 00:14:05.460
Yeah, I promise.

00:14:13.900 --> 00:14:15.880
Come out, Rai.

00:14:18.640 --> 00:14:21.250
Thank you, Thor. You saved me!

00:14:28.940 --> 00:14:31.770
<i>Rai, why back then...</i>

00:14:34.600 --> 00:14:37.250
<i>It was just an instant, but I thought about his death</i>

00:14:43.000 --> 00:14:44.410
<i>without any consideration.</i>

00:14:47.870 --> 00:14:49.880
<i>Who abandoned us here?...</i>

00:14:52.880 --> 00:14:55.090
Sorry for the wait; it took a bit of time.

00:15:08.650 --> 00:15:09.380
Thor!

00:15:16.080 --> 00:15:18.610
Wait, Thor. Where are you going?

00:15:18.950 --> 00:15:20.420
I'm going to Dagger Pagoda.

00:15:20.970 --> 00:15:23.450
I'll look for a way to leave this planet.

00:15:24.000 --> 00:15:26.500
How can you get there by yourself?

00:15:26.980 --> 00:15:28.560
I'll never know if I don't try.

00:15:29.730 --> 00:15:33.010
Leave me alone, I'm free to go to wherever I want.

00:15:33.020 --> 00:15:34.500
You are not!

00:15:34.990 --> 00:15:37.130
I've chosen you as my husband,

00:15:37.550 --> 00:15:39.840
and we're going have children here!

00:15:40.840 --> 00:15:43.430
I don't even like you! How can we get married?

00:15:44.420 --> 00:15:45.560
So get out of the way.

00:15:45.780 --> 00:15:46.480
No.

00:15:46.840 --> 00:15:47.600
Move!

00:15:48.200 --> 00:15:49.410
No!!!

00:15:50.230 --> 00:15:54.480
Well, well; the situation's becoming difficult.

00:15:55.080 --> 00:15:56.200
Rada, want to take a look?

00:15:56.420 --> 00:15:57.400
No thanks.

00:16:00.440 --> 00:16:02.040
Fine, I'll go this way then.

00:16:06.250 --> 00:16:07.190
Wha...what's this?

00:16:07.770 --> 00:16:10.410
It's filled with Musa's dead lives there.

00:16:10.800 --> 00:16:13.220
Well, it's just like an endless swamp;

00:16:13.770 --> 00:16:15.470
you won't be able to get out by yourself.

00:16:25.960 --> 00:16:26.690
What's happening?

00:16:27.160 --> 00:16:27.850
Don't tell me...

00:16:31.590 --> 00:16:34.410
It's only been 2 days since the temporary germination.

00:16:37.230 --> 00:16:38.880
Thor, get out of there!

00:16:38.930 --> 00:16:39.700
Hurry!

00:16:41.280 --> 00:16:42.380
Quickly, Thor!!!

00:16:43.920 --> 00:16:44.760
Hurry up!!!

00:16:52.080 --> 00:16:52.900
It's germinating!

00:16:59.240 --> 00:16:59.970
Tiz!

00:17:28.610 --> 00:17:30.000
Thor, your wound is...

00:17:38.540 --> 00:17:39.660
Let go of me, Thor.

00:17:39.990 --> 00:17:42.670
Musa's still growing; you can still get away!

00:17:43.880 --> 00:17:47.470
<i>That time, I couldn't save Rai.</i>

00:17:48.800 --> 00:17:52.470
<i>Even if I save this kid, it won't bring Rai back,</i>

00:17:53.550 --> 00:17:54.180
<i>but...</i>

00:17:57.350 --> 00:17:59.610
<i>... if I loosen my hand, I...</i>

00:18:01.290 --> 00:18:03.320
<i>...I would become a beast.</i>

00:18:06.770 --> 00:18:07.450
<i>Rai?</i>

00:18:09.640 --> 00:18:10.180
Thor!

00:18:13.590 --> 00:18:14.460
Hang on!

00:18:27.080 --> 00:18:28.550
Nice timing, huh?

00:18:29.030 --> 00:18:30.850
I'm so cool!

00:18:31.010 --> 00:18:33.630
You were too slow! We were just about to...

00:18:33.760 --> 00:18:34.740
Right, Thor?

00:18:37.140 --> 00:18:37.850
Thor?

00:18:39.230 --> 00:18:41.650
It's ok; he just fainted.

00:18:42.560 --> 00:18:45.410
But even with those injuries, he still held on?

00:18:46.300 --> 00:18:47.450
I don't d understand.

00:18:48.570 --> 00:18:54.330
He refused me, but then why did he risk his own life to save me?

00:18:55.940 --> 00:18:56.540
Who knows.

00:19:03.640 --> 00:19:04.830
This should be fine.

00:19:05.510 --> 00:19:07.930
Really, you are a worry.

00:19:08.700 --> 00:19:12.550
Thor, I heard that you came from Colony.

00:19:14.220 --> 00:19:16.520
I really can't understand what you did.

00:19:17.080 --> 00:19:19.410
Does everyone from Colony behave like this?

00:19:20.990 --> 00:19:24.120
I... I saved you for myself.

00:19:25.290 --> 00:19:26.780
Where I came from doesn't matter.

00:19:31.290 --> 00:19:33.830
Rika, give this to Chen;

00:19:34.750 --> 00:19:37.170
I'm giving up being Sun Ring's Second.

00:19:37.620 --> 00:19:39.450
I'm staying here forever, with Thor.

00:19:39.600 --> 00:19:40.840
Nonsense, Tiz.

00:19:41.290 --> 00:19:43.590
This isn't a place where women should stay.

00:19:43.900 --> 00:19:46.490
Then, just don't treat me as a woman.

00:19:46.680 --> 00:19:49.300
And anyway, I've received permission from the Top here.

00:19:50.130 --> 00:19:51.140
When...

00:19:51.840 --> 00:19:54.100
The Sun Ring female Tiz is dead!

00:19:54.550 --> 00:19:56.980
I'll be under Thor for the rest of my life!

00:19:57.000 --> 00:19:58.850
Eh? What do you mean?

00:19:59.380 --> 00:20:02.940
That necklace is called ''Ring Tiara", it's the symbol of a boss.

00:20:03.980 --> 00:20:06.570
She's returned it and left the Sun Ring.

00:20:07.160 --> 00:20:08.440
It's all for you.

00:20:09.310 --> 00:20:11.860
Which means, you've stepped up from "husband" to "boss''.

00:20:12.560 --> 00:20:15.950
Oh yeah, it's become interesting outside.

00:20:16.390 --> 00:20:17.200
Want to take a look?

00:20:26.070 --> 00:20:27.550
Already this many?...

00:20:28.170 --> 00:20:29.590
They're not done grow yet.

00:20:30.850 --> 00:20:33.340
They'll stick to each other and form a dome-like vault.

00:20:34.550 --> 00:20:37.680
Musa can suck water from deep underground.

00:20:38.890 --> 00:20:40.270
Because of the Musa's germination,

00:20:40.690 --> 00:20:43.400
there are huge disasters every year, but there's nothing we can do about it;

00:20:44.340 --> 00:20:47.360
we can only choose to live with it.

00:20:49.900 --> 00:20:50.530
<i>Rai.</i>

00:20:52.220 --> 00:20:55.370
<i>Why did you have to die here?</i>

00:20:56.690 --> 00:20:58.540
<i>Why did we come here?</i>

00:21:00.910 --> 00:21:02.790
<i>I will definitely find out the answer</i>

00:21:04.630 --> 00:21:05.900
<i>for your sake.</i>
